------------------------------------+\n   312\t| 26 `random-uuid` sites, `rpc` and `jing.dht` `rand`,| Fresh entropy and identities           | External (property 3). **Deferred** (§9.1).              |\n   313\t| `space.dht/secure-random-bytes`, `sign/generate`    |                                        |                                                          |\n   314\t+-----------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------+\n   315\t| `dao.jing.content.async`, `dao.jing.coordinate:80`  | Timers; JVM blocking driver with clock | External (property 4, 1). **Deferred** (§9.1).           |\n   316\t| with `dao.jing.content.driver` (clj lane),          | and sleep; host promises               |                                                          |\n   317\t| `dao.data.btree.storage` (async facade)             |                                        |                                                          |\n   318\t+-----------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------+\n   319\t| `yin.repl.main`, `yin.repl` (`:275-277` banner),    | Clock, stdin/stdout, exit, env         | Driver. `repl.cljc:275` and `fs.cljc:271` ambient reads   |\n   320\t| `yin.repl.state` (`dart:io`, `js/require`)          |                                        | deferred (§9.1).                                         |\n   321\t+-----------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------+\n   322\t| `yang.python.antlr.*`, `yang.antlr.cst` (x3),       | Generated recognizers; one `println`   | Stage: **deferred** (§9.3). The `println` is deferred    |\n   323\t| `yang.frontend`, `yang.stage`, `yin.repl.frontends` | (`repl.cljc:71`)                       | with it.                                